{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Gerrit 1613 merged as `57d192544c`. Gerrit 1620 PS1 exposed a guaranteed serial all-shard timeout in the bootstrap workflow. Consolidated the already-validated policy, head-only advisory, selector, and per-shard matrix commits into PS2 `fc33d17cfa`; focused workflow/mutation suite passes 80 tests and raw-Git guard passes. Two independent follow-ups remain: manifest timeout ownership and final docs/reporting."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786505783772159001,"uuid":"926caa32-5bf8-404a-9426-412c7a3795f6"}